&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1546989&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608471513&quot; alt=&quot;ashausesall&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1546989)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall&quot;  &gt;ashausesall&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;脚注&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-169464-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. 依照协议5925-Eshu，差错的细节已被隐去。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-169464-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. 依照协议5925-Eshu，逃脱的细节已被隐去。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-169464-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. 被描述为类似雄鹿的角。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-169464-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. 事后分析污渍后发现其为树脂，可能来源于反复击打橡树。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-169464-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. 俗称冬青。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
